Rebalance_parentToChild
├── given the active strategy is Parent Aave V3
├── and TVL was created through a real parent epoch deposit
├── when CRE initiates rebalance through Parent WorkflowRouter
├── then ParentVault should withdraw all TVL from Parent Aave V3
├── and ParentVault should send the TVL to Child through local CCIP
├── and ChildVault should deposit the TVL into Child Aave V3
├── and ParentVault should keep the rebalance pending
├── when CRE completes rebalance through Parent WorkflowRouter
├── then ParentVault should finalize the rebalance
├── and ParentVault should increment the rebalance nonce
└── and the active strategy should be Child Aave V3
